              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kiwi"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delicious! I halved the ingredients and put it in an 8x8 pan, using 1/3 c. egg whites instead of an egg. Like a chocolate chip cookie cake! Yum! Will probably make again!"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
